TITLE 1D exchange transport problem
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 1
    Cl 2
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7 charge
    Na 1
    Cl 1
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -lengths 1
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -initial_time 0
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file tran.sel
    -reset false
    -time
    -step
    -distance
    -solution 1
    -molalities Ca+2
END
